    "detailed_description": "Run and jump through 4 distinct world while collecting different sodas to boost you're abilities.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou are Soda an energetic young boy living in the city of Pemberton, one day a mysterious character only known as &quot;Dan&quot; steals the cities power and takes what's called &quot;Power Emblems&quot;. Its Soda's job to get the Power Emblems back and restore Pemberton to full power.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSoda has a range of dynamic abilities that you can use to traverse various levels, you can find certain permanent upgrades that add on to Soda's moveset letting him reach places otherwise unreachable. These upgrades can range from a double jump to wall kick, on top of that you have the ability to drink different sodas that give you a temporary buff to other aspects like top speed and health.",
    "about_the_game": "Run and jump through 4 distinct world while collecting different sodas to boost you're abilities.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou are Soda an energetic young boy living in the city of Pemberton, one day a mysterious character only known as &quot;Dan&quot; steals the cities power and takes what's called &quot;Power Emblems&quot;. Its Soda's job to get the Power Emblems back and restore Pemberton to full power.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSoda has a range of dynamic abilities that you can use to traverse various levels, you can find certain permanent upgrades that add on to Soda's moveset letting him reach places otherwise unreachable. These upgrades can range from a double jump to wall kick, on top of that you have the ability to drink different sodas that give you a temporary buff to other aspects like top speed and health.",
